{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d0afef86c3555c168f9ef78e4e5c1537c400eca2b74eeda329ff7965903e041c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1989a653baa1c98769ebfddc5953ee9bf8b728f4e9e04ff00efa4132ad1610c1",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n《星球射手》，终于下周就要上映了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa5423a9cd0fb0bf615f939f74e0cabec3dde405c00cfacb0e1bd0f690e9104",
      "text": "刚才看到街上贴出的广告了。\n看着那个，真实感就一下子涌上来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc30c4234eb851feaf09cb1e4e299e7e92d7d6ebfd7e4f6bc105e02b834a0e9d",
      "text": "……那个，●●●●プロデューサー。\n谢谢你给我接下了这份工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87704e690f31a3f700a5e7c944d51288ea27a6e796566fdd8b19cc94c942728a",
      "text": "这次除了给电影配音，还有主题曲和PV，\n宣传活动……要做的事情超级多吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9f64d388389324b18bdb1d7a2fb58fd5589e73d6704707b9a7b976603474655",
      "text": "在杂志采访中，也对至今为止的活动进行了\n相当深入的挖掘。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f79755843b69d0dd895bad0533baa1b07c5dd73dd364d6da0b9269a441988b",
      "text": "坐着宣传车四处跑的时候，\n能近距离看到粉丝的反应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29f7a526275f9ee610fa6fe206721909621a04bed1a9bbf60e3757451b9f70e3",
      "text": "虽然一开始听到详情时吓了一跳，\n但我觉得每一项能去尝试都太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6b6529f61bb7e72db393314ca3b53e43dc8c106d623d52aa2b170aeb150bb4e",
      "text": "过去的经验派上了用场，\n重新切身感受到粉丝存在的场面也很多。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc5c73fbcc0b264fd90d3098f2aed6fb944f05b84f951c46c571eee40dcf5f5",
      "text": "虽然很不容易，但非常充实，\n我觉得真是一份大有收获的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000025:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6b037bd3336bca75d9eab1a13af552579e1682f86c83296984469fdfe4afb49",
      "text": "今后也期待您的表现",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000026:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43e409d8d32332cf1818f3047169b78be54dd8653b770b90b3dd14c46ee303bc",
      "text": "很期待电影\n上映呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c4a3af9f3b08738f38dca251669a0f860ad75ff16f0cfaf407415bbd0c89733",
      "text": "我会活跃到超乎那份期待给你们看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7512b67145646a904906e5d6bce658a0b423e246d9b500ad86cce36702768703",
      "text": "嗯，是啊！能听到实际看过电影的粉丝\n的感想也很让人期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:001tom_403_2_4_001_03_09_a:2_4_001_03_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3b5df895b3ba2c458738e147352addb4237373310559e675df6155d38c1092",
      "text": "那就下一份工作也拜托你啦。\n辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
